  "description_short": "Cosy industrial cafe in George serving wholesome breakfasts, fresh salads, and daily-baked treats.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Laing Street in George's industrial area, The Green Door Cafe is a welcoming neighbourhood spot where honest cooking meets relaxed vibes. The menu focuses on generous breakfasts, fresh salads, hearty sandwiches, and daily-baked goods that draw a loyal local crowd throughout the day.\n\nThe cafe's unpretentious setting and friendly service make it an easy choice for a casual breakfast meeting, midweek lunch, or weekend catch-up over coffee. With quality ingredients and genuine care in the kitchen, it's the kind of place that feels like a secret worth sharing—though the steady stream of regulars suggests the word is already out.",
